UID:627e0aceba3fcab45400bfc2fe2d01f2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Health & Wellness\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nDo you hav
 e questions about health insurance? Stop by the library to speak with an e
 xpert from RN Insurance Navigators. Their representatives can steer you th
 rough the confusing world of health insurance plans\, Medicare\, Medicaid\
 , and Pennie to help you find the right coverage to meet your health and f
 inancial needs.Consultations are FREE - Walk-ins are welcome!
