BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Duplo Free Play
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T150000
UID:5f51f9cccc887b0cbbf3006447da3c68@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Toddlers\, Children\n\nDrop-in program. No registration
  required.Join us for a fun and engaging play session designed for childre
 n ages 2-7! Using colorful Lego Duplo blocks\, kids can explore their crea
 tivity\, improve fine motor skills\, and build their imagination through h
 ands-on play. This program encourages collaborative play and parent-child 
 interaction.Perfect for young builders of all skill levels\, this free pro
 gram offers a relaxed and welcoming environment for families to connect an
 d create together. Come play\, learn\, and grow at the library! Each famil
 y group must include a responsible adult in the room at all times. This pr
 ogram is for children 2 to 7 years old only! While other ages are welcome 
 in the room\, we kindly ask that the play area and toys remain reserved ex
 clusively for the intended age group to ensure a safe environment for youn
 g participants.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/duplo-free-play-153730
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Read Aloud with Pepper the Dog!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T150000
UID:15420e2bc21cec71aad9e9a2733a37d7@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Health & Wellness\, Children\, Everyone\n\nDid you
  know?  Research shows that therapy dogs help people to improve attention 
 span\, focus\, & well-being and that reluctant readers enjoy and benefit f
 rom reading aloud to a pup. Children of all ages (accompanied by their par
 ent or other caregiver) are invited to spend some time with and read aloud
  to Pepper\, a friendly and adorable Labrador Retriever who will be accomp
 anied by Mrs. Carol Stark. (Pepper has a Canine Good Citizen certificate f
 rom the American Kennel Club and is certified for excellence at the Advanc
 ed level by PAWS for People.)No registration required.
LOCATION:Eastern Lancaster County\, NHD Children's Play Area
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/read-aloud-pepper-dog-18
 0118
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
