BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1st Annual College Night
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T193000
UID:cfad1ff4d01bdca7225e3175f85604a2@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Business & Career\, Community\, Discussion\, Finance\, Present
 ation\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nUnlock Your Future: Manheim Community 
 Library’s 1st Annual Higher Education Fair.Are you a high school student
  or parent navigating the path to post-secondary education? Join us for an
  all-inclusive\, high-impact evening designed to take the guesswork out of
  the college planning process!Whether you’re just starting your search o
 r preparing to submit applications\, this premier event brings representat
 ives from Elizabethtown College\, F&M\, Thaddeus Stevens\, Lebanon Valley 
 College\, and Millersville University—alongside financial experts and ad
 missions counselors—directly to you under one roof.Direct Access to Admi
 ssions: Meet face-to-face with representatives from top local colleges and
  universities. Ask questions\, explore academic programs\, discover campus
  life\, and collect official admissions resources.On-Site Application Hub:
  Ready to take the next step? Get real-time guidance and complete your off
 icial college applications directly at the event.Expert Financial Breakdow
 n: Demystify tuition\, scholarships\, and financial aid during a featured 
 presentation by financial advisor Anne Seitz Brown RICP®\, CCPS®\, CLTC
 ®\, CDFA®\, BFA™️as she shares smart\, insider strategies to fund yo
 ur college educationInteractive Breakout Sessions: Tailor your experience 
 with localized group sessions covering crucial topics—from writing stand
 out application essays to managing college entrance requirements 4:15 PM -
  6:15 PMEvent DetailsLocation: Manheim Community LibraryAdmission: Free & 
 open to all local high school students and families
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/1s-annual-college-night-
 196762
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
