 ryone.🏆 What’s on the Line?First Place: A gift certificate to our Boo
 kstore + eternal glory (and bragging rights) on our official Winners Wall!
 Monthly Mystery Prize: A special rotating bonus prize awarded to our champ
 ions each month!📋How It WorksTeam Up: Come with a group or join a team 
