 ’re gathering to enjoy the gorgeous footpath right here around our libra
 ry complex. It’s the perfect chance to stretch your legs\, chat with nei
 ghbors\, and soak in the beautiful surroundings.When: Every Friday from 10
 :30 AM – 11:30 AMWhere: Meet at the library!What to bring: Lace up your 
 favorite walking sneakers\, dress comfortably for the weather\, and don't 
