DESCRIPTION:Presentation\, Children\, Everyone\n\nLearn about the whole pr
 ocess of making maple syrup from how the Native Americans did it to how it
  is processed today. Participants will learn about maple trees through the
  seasons\, how to identify them and how to collect sap from them. The tool
 s of the trade will be examined. See how to boil the sap down to syrup and
  the syrup will be turned into candy for everyone to taste. No registratio
 n required! Recommended for school age kids and families!
