UID:8dbed8fafc0833027e663f41e52b548e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nCooks & Books cel
 ebrates Spanish Heritage Month by diving into the bold\, soulful flavors o
 f Puerto Rico! Whether we’re exploring the traditional staples of the Ea
 sy Puerto Rican Cookbook or the modern\, mainland-meets-island recipes of 
 Diasporican\, it’s all about the 'holy trinity' of garlic\, peppers\, an
 d onions. Come for the sofrito\, stay for the stories\, and discover why t
 he kitchen is the heart of the Puerto Rican home!Bonus Activity: Spice & S
 easoning Swap! Bring a spice\, seasoning blend\, or favorite condiment to 
 trade with fellow home cooks. (Please bring your own packaging or containe
 rs for swap items!)🍽️Cooks & Books is a welcoming space for anyone wh
 o loves food and cooking. Bring a dish inspired by Puerto Rican cuisine\, 
 your own place setting and serving utensils\, and a friend to join the con
 versation!Requirements: Attendees should be 14 years of age or older. Vega
 n and vegetarian recipes are always welcome.Supplies: Please bring your ow
 n serving utensils\, place setting\, to-go container\, and beverage.Cost: 
 The event is free\, but reservations are required!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/cooks-books-el-sabor-de-
 la-isla-flavor-island-160163
