BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Freeze Your Bills\, Not Your House!:  Winterizing your Home & Gard
 en to Save Money When the Temperature Drops
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260929T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260929T200000
UID:9404bb3204005a2559a5ddce33c49d45@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Presentation\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nGet ready to up
 grade your winter game and keep more cash in your pocket! ❄️💰Join t
 he Manheim Township Sustainability Advisory Committee (MT SAC) and the MTP
 L Library for an action-packed session loaded with practical tips to prote
 ct your home\, boost local wildlife\, and cut costs as the cold weather ro
 lls in.We’re excited to host local experts for live talks and valuable t
 akeaways:🌿 Linda Ferich (Lancaster Conservancy) will share simple\, lat
 e-fall ecological practices to help local wildlife thrive through the wint
 er.⚡ Andrew Pauls-Thomas (RegenAll) will dive into actionable steps to s
 lash your energy bills and optimize your space.📋 Bonus Take-Home Guide:
  Material scientist Marsha Bischel\, PhD (MT SAC) is putting together an e
 xclusive handout packed with top insulation and winterization hacks to kee
 p your home cozy.With utility costs on the rise\, getting ahead of the chi
 ll is a total game-changer. You’ll walk away with clear\, easy strategie
 s to:🐦 Support winter wildlife using eco-friendly yard care tips.💡 K
 eep energy costs low without sacrificing comfort.🏡 Insulate like a pro 
 using simple changes that add up to big savings.Small tweaks today mean hu
 ge savings (and a healthier backyard) this winter. Don't miss out!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center C
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/reserved-program-194954
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
