  Lancaster County Central Park's Environmental Center to take a group hike
  and learn about what trees\, flowers\, and wildlife are in the park and h
 ow to identify them in your own backyard.The LPL On-the-Go van will make a
 n appearance at the program so we can discuss and check out relevant mater
 ials.Good to know info:Adults onlyRegistration is REQUIREDWear appropriate
  shoes and clothes for an outdoor 1.25-mile hike on the park's Scout Trail
 Park outside the Environmental Center and meet with librarian Erin Endres 
 and Naturalist Ann Strauss before heading on the trail.
