 s 6–17 MonthsCome sing\, play\, and grow together! Busy Babies is a play
 ful\, hands-on class designed for babies ages 6–17 months and their care
 givers. Each class gives little ones opportunities to explore\, move\, dis
 cover\, and socialize while caregivers learn simple ways to support early 
 development through everyday play.Classes feature monthly themes\, songs a
 nd fingerplays\, interactive activities\, sensory exploration\, movement\,
  books\, and socialization. Babies can practice important early skills suc
 h as communication\, coordination\, problem-solving\, imitation\, and soci
 al-emotional development—all while having fun alongside their grownup an
 d new friends.What We’ll Do TogetherEach month introduces a fun new them
 e with activities that encourage babies to:🎵 Sing & move with songs\, f
 ingerplays\, and movement games📚 Read & explore age-appropriate books\,
  puppets\, and story props🖐️ Touch & discover through sensory and han
 ds-on activities🧸 Play & learn with simple activities that encourage cu
 riosity and problem-solving💕 Connect & socialize with caregivers and ot
 her babies🚼 Move & grow through crawling\, cruising\, dancing\, reachin
 g\, and other age-appropriate movement👀 Look\, listen & communicate thr
 ough playful interactions\, gestures\, sounds\, and early language activit
 ies
