BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Toddler Time
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261013T104500
UID:9520d4e74609e0776edb517872c036c6@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Toddlers\n\nA time for Toddlers with their grown-u
 p\, dedicated to stories\, discovery and exploring!  (18 months to 36 mont
 hs\, with adult. Other family members welcome.)Adults attending with their
  child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional registrants
  to your registration if more than one child that will be participating in
  the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, September 30t
 h for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, October
  2nd for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo Show – P
 atrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library progra
 ms in a month will be restricted from registering for future programs for 
 a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 
 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waitin
 g list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals
  – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow f
 or parking and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the
  designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on t
 he wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may 
 be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted t
 o enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Adults – 
 This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please plan to 
 attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be permitted.Can
 cellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify that the 
 program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limited to one
  session of multiple session programs per week.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/toddler-time-169484
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
