DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T114500
UID:c7371ed21776faf2c9be0dd37440e0e5@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Storytime\, Children\n\nDesigned to spark curiosity and a love
  for learning in young children\, this program features stories\, songs\, 
 and hands-on activities tailored for preschool-aged kids. Each session foc
 uses on building early literacy\, motor skills\, and social interaction th
 rough playful exploration.Perfect for ages 3–6 with an adult\, this prog
 ram provides a welcoming and inclusive environment where kids can learn an
 d grow together. Parents and caregivers are encouraged to participate and 
 share in the joy of discovery with their little ones.Adults attending with
  their child(ren) do NOT need to register. Please add any additional regis
 trants to your registration if more than one child that will be participat
 ing in the program.Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, Septemb
 er 16th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Friday\, S
 eptember 18th for residents of other municipalities.Storytime PoliciesNo S
 how – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 libra
 ry programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future prog
 rams for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations 
 at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those on t
 he waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.Late
  Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program t
 o allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin prompt
 ly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to t
 hose on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registr
 ants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be pe
 rmitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Accompanying Ad
 ults – This program is for adults and children to enjoy together. Please
  plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Drop offs will not be perm
 itted.Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departing to verify 
 that the program has not been cancelled.Program Limits - Patrons are limit
 ed to one session of multiple session programs per week.Preschool Party Re
 gistration Requirements – All children who will be participating in the 
 craft will need to be registered as a participant to allow for adequate su
 pplies.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Lapp Story Silo
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/preschool-party-169533
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Medicare Open Enrollment
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261110T150000
UID:fa54a0ee8cd62d7aaa5a96c72aaf7826@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Health & Wellness\, Seniors\n\nMedicare Annual Open Enrollment
  Appointments at Quarryville LibraryLancaster County Office of Aging runs 
 a program called PA Medi\, formerly APPRISE. This group assists those with
  questions about Medicare\, Medicaid\, and other health insurance all year
  round.   They will be scheduling appointments in their office: 150 N. Que
 en St.\, Lancaster\, and at other sites all over the county during October
  – December\, 2026.  Please call 717-299-7979 to set up an appointment a
 t Quarryville Library or elsewhere. They will meet with you individually\,
  confidentially\, to go over what Medicare Plan you currently have\, and t
 o see if upcoming 2027 plans are the same\, have higher premiums\, are sti
 ll available\, etc.  If your coverage remains the same and you like it\, y
 ou don’t have to do anything.  Drug or RX plans are those you can switch
  at this time of year. You can also switch from an Advantage Plan to anoth
 er Advantage Plan or to an Original Medicare Plan. Insurance changes made 
 during the Open Enrollment time become effective January 1\, 2027.
LOCATION:Quarryville\, QVL Story Corner/Early Literacy Lab
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/medicare-open-enrollment
 -176083
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
