  your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted
  entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. How
 ever\, registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes pa
 st the start time.Check In - All participants must provide an emergency co
 ntact number upon registration or at the start of the program.
